WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:07.980
You need five kitchen tools to use as beaks, such as a clothespin, tongs, and

2
00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:12.020
tweezers. Set up five food stations, from seeds to nectar.

3
00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:15.200
Set the five stations around the table.

4
00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:17.040
Lay the beak tools in a row.

5
00:00:17.840 --> 00:00:22.860
Your child tries three beaks at each station for 30 seconds and counts what lands in

6
00:00:22.860 --> 00:00:23.860
the cup.

7
00:00:23.983 --> 00:00:27.323
Often the clothespin wins at seeds, and the straw wins at nectar.

8
00:00:27.803 --> 00:00:30.563
Your results may differ, and that is useful to talk about.

9
00:00:31.367 --> 00:00:33.247
Stay with your child the whole time.

10
00:00:34.207 --> 00:00:38.647
Beans, seeds, cereal, and pasta are choking hazards for children under four.

11
00:00:39.367 --> 00:00:40.507
Nobody eats the food.

12
00:00:41.167 --> 00:00:42.767
Keep toddlers away from the water.
